{"track":"python","category":"문자열·리스트","level":2,"title":"행별 합계","desc":"<p>2차원 리스트의 <b>각 행의 합</b>을 리스트로 돌려주는 <code>row_sums(m)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def row_sums(m):\n    pass\n","solution":"def row_sums(m):\n    return [sum(row) for row in m]\n","hint":"<p>컴프리헨션 안에서 행마다 <code>sum(row)</code>.</p>","tests":[{"call":"row_sums([[1, 2], [3, 4]])","expected":[3,7],"visible":true},{"call":"row_sums([[5]])","expected":[5],"visible":true},{"call":"row_sums([[0, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1]])","expected":[0,3],"visible":false},{"call":"row_sums([])","expected":[],"visible":false}],"id":"py-058"}